#: apps-src/apps/libleagor_basic/dcamera/leagor_dcamera.cpp:92
msgid "[Leagor]because load OrbbecSDK.dll, don't support dcamera remark"
msgstr ""
"在windows系统，不清楚加载OrbbecSDK.dll要依赖什么，在一些电脑会失败。为不让出"
"问题，发布windows下的Basic时，不包含深度相机功能。若要有深度相机功能，可做以"
"下修改。\n"
"1、在Linker，增加依赖：../../../linker/windows/lib/x64/OrbbecSDK.lib\n"
"2、编译orbbec下的ob_camera_node.cpp、ob_camera_node_driver.cpp、"
"orbbec_ros.cpp、ros_sensor.cpp、utils.cpp。\n"
"3、leagor_dcamera.cpp的tleagor_dcamera::tleagor_dcamera，在_WIN32分支，让和其"
"它平台一样执行“device_ = orbbec_create_device()”。\n"
"4、leagor_dcamera.cpp的aplt_create_dcamera_slot，support_windows改为值为"
"true。"

